{"@context":"https://flpgiacomini.github.io/atlas/context/v2.jsonld","id":"atlas:event:pandemic-disruption-and-electric-resilience-2020-2021","type":"Event","name":"Ruptura pandêmica e resiliência elétrica: 2020–2021","aliases":["Fábricas paradas, elétricos em alta"],"description":"A pandemia interrompe fábricas e cadeias globais, contrai o mercado automotivo e, ao mesmo tempo, acelera a participação dos automóveis elétricos.","claims":[{"id":"atlas:claim:pandemic-production-loss-2020","type":"Claim","subject":"atlas:event:pandemic-disruption-and-electric-resilience-2020-2021","predicate":"began-on","object":{"type":"date","value":"2020","precision":"year"},"sources":["atlas:source:acea-covid-production-2020","atlas:source:iea-ev-covid-2020"],"evidence":["atlas:evidence:acea-production-loss-2020","atlas:evidence:iea-electric-resilience-2020"],"confidence":"high","validity":{"from":"2020","until":"2020","precision":"year"}},{"id":"atlas:claim:ev-sales-double-2021","type":"Claim","subject":"atlas:event:pandemic-disruption-and-electric-resilience-2020-2021","predicate":"ended-on","object":{"type":"date","value":"2021","precision":"year"},"sources":["atlas:source:iea-global-ev-outlook-2022"],"evidence":["atlas:evidence:iea-ev-sales-2021"],"confidence":"high","validity":{"from":"2021","until":"2021","precision":"year"}}],"sources":[{"id":"atlas:source:acea-covid-production-2020","type":"Source","title":"COVID-19 impact on EU automobile production, full-year 2020","publisher":"European Automobile Manufacturers’ Association","url":"https://www.acea.auto/figure/interactive-map-covid-19-impact-on-eu-automobile-production-full-year-2020/","trust":"industry-institution","verifiedAt":"2026-08-24"},{"id":"atlas:source:iea-ev-covid-2020","type":"Source","title":"How global electric car sales defied Covid-19 in 2020","publisher":"International Energy Agency","url":"https://www.iea.org/commentaries/how-global-electric-car-sales-defied-covid-19-in-2020","trust":"intergovernmental","verifiedAt":"2026-08-24"},{"id":"atlas:source:iea-global-ev-outlook-2022","type":"Source","title":"Global EV Outlook 2022 — Executive summary","publisher":"International Energy Agency","url":"https://www.iea.org/reports/global-ev-outlook-2022/executive-summary","trust":"intergovernmental","verifiedAt":"2026-08-24"}],"evidence":[{"id":"atlas:evidence:acea-production-loss-2020","type":"Evidence","source":"atlas:source:acea-covid-production-2020","evidenceType":"industry-statistics","locator":{"year":"2020"},"notes":"A ACEA estima perda de 4.243.577 veículos na produção da União Europeia em 2020 por paralisações e recuperação incompleta da capacidade."},{"id":"atlas:evidence:iea-electric-resilience-2020","type":"Evidence","source":"atlas:source:iea-ev-covid-2020","evidenceType":"intergovernmental-analysis","locator":{"year":"2020"},"notes":"A IEA registra queda aproximada de 14% no mercado global de automóveis, enquanto vendas elétricas ultrapassaram três milhões."},{"id":"atlas:evidence:iea-ev-sales-2021","type":"Evidence","source":"atlas:source:iea-global-ev-outlook-2022","evidenceType":"intergovernmental-statistics","locator":{"year":"2021"},"notes":"A IEA registra 6,6 milhões de elétricos vendidos em 2021, quase 10% das vendas globais de automóveis."}],"metadata":{"editorial_level":"editorial","editorial_batch":"V2-2020S-01","region_cluster":"Mundo 2020-2026","reviewed_at":"2026-08-24","temporal_status":"confirmed"}}
